        "type": "practiceLevel2",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149454,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why should we build accessible game UI?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"4\" correct=\"true\">Both options</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">To make game menus and HUDs usable for everyone, including players with disabilities</item><item value=\"5\" correct=\"false\">To help players navigate and interact with game screens in a clear way</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Both options.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149455,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How can we make game UI more accessible?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By coding HTML in a semantic manner for menus and HUD</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By ignoring non-mandatory attributes like <code>alt</code> on images</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">By designing the UI only for typical players</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By coding HTML in a semantic manner for menus and HUD.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149456,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why should we use elements like <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;main&gt;</code>, etc in a game website or web game menu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">So that players using a screen reader can jump to sections like the HUD, menu, and main game area</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because otherwise the game won't run</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">So that it looks fancy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">So that players using a screen reader can jump to sections like the HUD, menu, and main game area.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149457,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which of the following is <em>not</em> a generic element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;header&gt;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;span&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;header&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149458,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We are trying to keep a game UI as accessible as possible. Should we have an <code>h2</code> after an <code>h5</code> in the same screen section?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">No, we must keep the heading order</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yes, we can use headings for styling</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">No, <code>&lt;h5&gt;</code> comes after <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, we must keep the heading order.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149459,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is wrong with this code?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"alert\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Boss fight starts in 10 seconds. \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The <code>\"alert\"</code> value should have double quotes </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing; it works for me</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>role</code> attribute cannot be used on a <code>div</code> element</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The <code>\"alert\"</code> value should have double quotes .</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149460,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Does the webpage display two paragraphs in this example?<br /></p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"New Level Unlocked\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Press Start\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Yes, because the attribute hides content only to screen readers</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, it won't display <code>\"New Level Unlocked\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Yes, because the attribute hides content only to screen readers.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149461,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>img</code> and <code>h1</code> elements are at the top of a game page. Add the correct role to the <code>div</code> that contains them.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;banner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/forrest-walk.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"alt\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;hero sprite&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200px&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" /&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Forest Quest\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>banner</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149462,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>These pieces of information should appear at the bottom of every game page. What <code>role</code> do we need to use here?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"banner\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;contentinfo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game UI Accessibility\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Build 1\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Copyright © 2012-2013\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>contentinfo</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>banner</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>comment</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>contentinfo</code>.</p><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>contentinfo</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149463,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We must hide the <code>button</code> and the <code>p</code> elements from the screen readers. Let's add the correct attribute to hide them.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"aria\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"aria-hide\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aria-hidden\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Open Dev Cheats\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Screen Readers shouldn't see this\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"div\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>aria-hidden</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
